    <title>Assessment</title>
    <text><list><item>Progressive hearing loss in both ears over about three years, worse on the left, with poor understanding of soft speech; type and cause not yet established at intake; audiology and otolaryngology evaluation requested: active, confirmed [S]</item><item>Persistent, bothersome tinnitus in both ears for about three years, constant ringing and buzzing day and night, with intolerance of loud sound; synthetic modern episode linked to his documented tinnitus: active, confirmed [S]</item><item>Adjustment disorder with depressed mood in response to progressive hearing loss, with withdrawal from social gatherings; synthetic modern episode linked to his documented despair and isolation: active, confirmed [S]</item></list></text>

